# Secrets must be supplied at runtime, never through COPY or the build context.
**/.env*
**/*.env
**/.npmrc
**/.pypirc
**/.netrc
**/pip.conf
**/.credentials
**/*credentials*.json
**/*token*.json
**/*secrets*.json
**/*private-baseline*
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.keystore
**/id_rsa*
**/id_ed25519*
**/.ssh
**/.aws
**/.azure
**/.config/gcloud
**/.vault-token
**/kubeconfig*
**/*.tfstate*

# Source-control metadata, local tooling, caches and crash/session recordings.
**/.git
**/.codex
**/.claude
**/.railway
**/.emergent
**/.idea
**/.vscode
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.venv
**/venv
**/.cache
**/.pytest_cache
**/coverage
**/.next
frontend/build

# Backups/logs are not runtime application inputs.
**/backups
**/*.log
**/*.sqlite*
**/dump.rdb
**/*dump*.sql
**/*.tar
**/*.tar.gz
**/*.tgz
**/*.zip

# Fixtures contain synthetic credentials and are never production entrypoints.
backend/test_*.py
backend/browser_fixture.py
frontend/e2e
frontend/src/**/*.test.*
